    "parsed_response": {
      "turns": [
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good afternoon, this is Tan Hui Min. Thank you for calling. Are you somewhere you can speak comfortably, or would you prefer a little time to settle?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Hello, Hui Min. I'm in my office and can speak now. 我是林文杰，今天想用电话谈，比较方便。 [[EV_013]] [[EV_014]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. I will keep the conversation focused. [[EV_001]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Telephone contact is generally easier than a long email exchange. 我的工作邮件很多，私人事务夹在里面，很容易被压下去。 A conversation helps me keep the administrative matters separate."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "We can use this call for the discussion without adding a lengthy email exchange. [[EV_002]] [[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_004]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_005]] [[EV_006]] [[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Let me close the office door before we carry on. 外面有同事在谈工作，声音有点杂。 I usually try to keep personal administration away from the work desk, but that hasn't happened today."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Take your time. There is no need to speak over the background conversation. If an interruption comes up, just tell me and we can pause."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "That's better; the door is closed now. [[EV_015]] [[EV_021]] [[EV_018]] [[EV_019]] [[EV_020]] [[EV_022]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_016]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_017]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "抱歉，刚才口误了。 [[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_011]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "We can pause here while you attend to work. Is there anything else you wanted to raise before we finish the conversation?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_012]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "You sound occupied, so I will let you attend to your colleagues. Thank you for speaking with me today."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "谢谢，今天办公室确实有点忙。 I'll leave the conversation there. Goodbye."
        }
      ]
